      "notes": "Maximum ratings (VCEO 45, 60, 80 V, IC 1.5 A, PD 12.5 W at 25 C case); hFE 25 minimum at 5 mA and 500 mA, 40 to 250 at 150 mA; VCE(sat) 0.5 V at 0.5 A, 50 mA; VBE(on) 1 V at 0.5 A; TO-225 E1 C2 B3; the ordering information."
    }
  },
  "evidence": [
    "\\(IC = 0\\.005 A, VCE = 2 V\\) 25 − \\(IC = 0\\.15 A, VCE = 2 V\\) 40 250 \\(IC = 0\\.5 A VCE = 2 V\\) 25",
    "\\(IC = 0\\.5 Adc, IB = 0\\.05 Adc\\) − 0\\.5",
    "\\(IC = 0\\.5 Adc, VCE = 2\\.0 Vdc\\) − 1",
    "Collector Current IC 1\\.5 Adc",
    "@ TC = 25°C 12\\.5 Watts"
